{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2023-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1672531200, "end_date": 1675209599, "month_true_total": 11, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131672455", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972177448", "personaname": "Ghoul Patrol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972177448/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1407, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 692, "last_played": 1678381234, "avatar": "204330c6f6817a15b29c0d829578e66db7623b79"}, "language": "english", "review": "Way to much gun reloading, and it becomes very annoying fast.\nThe Geth cheat, just check out the Geth Rocker Troopers tactics.\nFOV is too narrow.\nLong Skill recharge times = to an mmorpg\nTerrible keyboard controls.\nRNG boxes that require grinding currency for items.\nI enjoyed it for a while in 2012 because I got hold of the Krogan Soldier and the M37 very early, and once those two are fully upgraded you are unstoppable.\nBut now I hate it.", "timestamp_created": 1674847534, "timestamp_updated": 1674906513, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131393635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198271736525", "personaname": "sNeeeZe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Hyperdimension-Gaming/", "num_games_owned": 68, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1515, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1515, "last_played": 1674466929, "avatar": "9e78f8b268ad3b4ecd5b6334ed68cba09b4c9d43"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is such a great game with great story.", "timestamp_created": 1674467025, "timestamp_updated": 1674467025, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131375539", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974102377", "personaname": "Jake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974102377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 1027, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1027, "last_played": 1633328116, "avatar": "7bed098f4005d6949d5b494a44a6d1b77fd33821"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, but a horrible ending.\n\nI suggest either skipping the last ten minutes and imagining your own ending, or using the ending modification mod that everyone is using.", "timestamp_created": 1674435912, "timestamp_updated": 1674435912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520593583583831787", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131366917", "author": {"steamid": "76561199215516995", "personaname": "Boxing Raccoon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199215516995/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2621, "last_played": 1674368810, "avatar": "8896fe2a855fbb58ff1950e505477baefe5744ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love this game, both Mass Effect 2 and 3, tstory rich describes it accurately. Lot's of story, lots of dialogue, interesting characters and some customization, special powers that you can level up or customize, as well as your guns. In space. If hot action is all you care about this might not be the game for you, but if you are into story rich games, mixed with some action, try it, it's a great game. I think it's worth the money, but if you find it as a special or with some sort of disscount, go for it, you won't be dissapointed.", "timestamp_created": 1674423308, "timestamp_updated": 1674423308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131020664", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061760000", "personaname": "JohnnyBoi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/em11613/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 601, "last_played": 1674312640, "avatar": "b0758506cd74319e72456c5734285b4e522b3735"}, "language": "english", "review": "12/10", "timestamp_created": 1673947505, "timestamp_updated": 1673947505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130884781", "author": {"steamid": "76561198386440830", "personaname": "nepzz4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198386440830/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 40, "deck_playtime_at_review": 40, "last_played": 1674070231, "avatar": "18a83618826891dd83bdc2d6df899cddd72051be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game runs smooth